  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Social Cohesion and Integrating Violence-affected Local Communities through Participatory Area-based Recovery in Syria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity building for participatory area-based recovery, Construction participatory area-based recovery</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project is expected to contribute to enabling the recovery and building the resilience of selected communities in Syria through promoting social cohesion and enhancing the integration of conflict and violence-affected local communities to advance once resilience and early recovery in Syria, build the economic capacity and enhance the economic empowerment of vulnerable people through more equitable access to critical essential services and dignified livelihoods.&#xC9C0;&#xC5ED; &#xCC38;&#xC5EC;&#xD615; &#xBCF5;&#xAD6C;&#xC804;&#xB7B5; &#xD50C;&#xB7AB;&#xD3FC;&#xC5D0;&#xC11C; &#xC218;&#xB9BD;&#xB418;&#xACE0; &#xC9C0;&#xBC29;&#xB2F9;&#xAD6D;&#xC5D0; &#xC758;&#xD574; &#xC2B9;&#xC778;&#xB41C; &#xD3EC;&#xAD04;&#xC801;&#xC9C0;&#xC5ED; &#xBCF5;&#xAD6C;&#xC804;&#xB7B5; &#xD655;&#xB300;</narrative>
  </description>
